        '', 'The preparation command recomposes S6 from original pixels and fixed saved alignments, then AB/PRESENCE from that detector and fetched reader inputs. It does not need SF4 overlays. **Local original projection parity passed on all 14 corrected audit witnesses:** detector serialization, AB/PRESENCE proposal text and detailed holds, status, released label, changes and gate decisions match L1M. See [L1M_original_projection_parity.json](S8_DEV/evidence/L1M_original_projection_parity.json). JSON-normalized comparisons account for stored lists versus Python tuples. This witness check does not establish a 600-line baseline.',
