        '', 'Validation: all 124 final word windows were inspected in four raster QA sheets; ten control word/line pairs were inspected. Machine checks verify all 48 selected IDs, exact seeded 20% sampling, every disputed eligible word, hidden keys/flags, blank answers, original strip pixels and word rasters, ≤3× geometry, 48/48 reader/alignment identities, 14/14 projection parity for both modes, and unchanged frozen source/model hashes. See [audit_validation.json](S8_DEV/evidence/audit_validation.json) and [audit_visual_review.json](S8_DEV/evidence/audit_visual_review.json). Native source washout/damage remains visible. Browser layout was not checked because no CUA browser surface was available.',
